    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529010/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.poster.avif?t=1749714584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529010/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.webm?t=1749714584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>This is a free version of the turn-based combat game with rogue-like and deck-building elements One More Try.<br><br>PROLOGUE FEATURES<br><br>2 playable characters<br>3 combat locations<br>10 attack dices<br>20+ relics<br><br>One More Try is a turn-based roguelite game where your deck is made up of dice!<br><br>Each dice represents a different action, from attacking or healing, to empowering other dice or copying their abilities. Improve your deck and collect new, stronger dice with unique abilities to create a unique combination.<br><br>- Special properties and improvements to dice<br>- Hero leveling system<br>- Unique relics",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529010/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.poster.avif?t=1749714584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529010/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.webm?t=1749714584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>This is a free version of the turn-based combat game with rogue-like and deck-building elements One More Try.<br><br>PROLOGUE FEATURES<br><br>2 playable characters<br>3 combat locations<br>10 attack dices<br>20+ relics<br><br>One More Try is a turn-based roguelite game where your deck is made up of dice!<br><br>Each dice represents a different action, from attacking or healing, to empowering other dice or copying their abilities. Improve your deck and collect new, stronger dice with unique abilities to create a unique combination.<br><br>- Special properties and improvements to dice<br>- Hero leveling system<br>- Unique relics",
